      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I wonder if VRChat could display memory usage per avatar and for the world. My suspicion is that the recent Quest update requires more RAM, so there is less for the game to use, and maybe quest users could use hard  numbers to understand whether or not to use the option to show very poor avatars.\n\nThe 4gb cache takes up storage, not RAM. \n\nI did see one comment mentioning that the headset might keep other guardians in RAM, like if you were to have more than one place set up.\n\nPersonally I'd expect a game to be able to ask for more RAM and be told no, and figure something out, instead of asking for more and dying.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
