  "details": "Open Vrchat and just play on Quest platform. Eventually you will receive the error \"You have been sent home because your system ran out of memory\" or vrchat will simply close/crash despite your system having plenty of memory remaining and the cache not even having near the 4gb limit.\n\nPLEASE get to the bottom of this. It never used to happen up until 3 months ago.\n\nIt's extremely frustrating for us quest users to deal with.",
